    "Earlier exchanges are omitted, so all model/tool turns are not visible.",
    "The content of material_density_table.md is not included, so the expected mass cannot be independently recomputed.",
    "The single BACKGROUND_TASK_FAILED event is not detailed."
  ],
  "uncertainties": [
    "It is not possible to assert whether the model intended to call Write but was interrupted, or whether it was generating a final text response when the stream failed.",
    "The discrepancy between non-empty provider tail content and empty framework-captured model content may be due to logging projection, sanitization, or framework discarding an incomplete response; the available evidence does not prove runtime argument corruption.",
    "The missing finish_reason/done marker could originate from the model provider, the model itself, or an intermediate gateway normalization layer; the evidence shows the protocol failure but not the exact component responsible."
  ]
}
